{"slug":"Survive-in-the-Facility-Revamp-Open-Source-195552","_id":"69d7d4a8e52e8dc73fa32f93","title":"Open Source","game":{"_id":"69d52ae0e52e8dc73f6d5932","gameId":107946054053457,"name":"Survive in the Facility Revamp","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":107946054053457},"features":"the script does this:\n- Increases Firerate\n- Makes your bullets do explosive damage across the entire map (set ExplosionRadius to 15 to get it normal again)\n-Decreases Reload Time\n- Removes Bullet Spread Completely\n- Makes all guns fully automatic\nNote: You can change whatever you want on it, don't set the Firerate below 0.03 or you will get kicked by the anti-cheat.\nScript made by me (If you want more scripts for a specific game, comment below <3)","tags":[],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal player = Players.LocalPlayer\n\nlocal function updatetool()\n    local backpack = player:WaitForChild(\"Backpack\")\n\n    for _, tool in ipairs(backpack:GetChildren()) do\n        if tool:IsA(\"Tool\") and tool:FindFirstChild(\"Settings\") then\n            local module = tool.Settings\n            local r = require(module)\n            r.Auto = true\n            r.Firerate = 0.05\n            r.ReloadTime = 0\n            r.Explosive = true\n            r.Spread = 0\n            r.CameraShakeEnabled = false\n            r.ExplosionRadius = 99999\n        end\n    end\nend\nupdatetool()\n\nplayer.CharacterAdded:Connect(function()\n    task.wait(0.5)\n    updatetool()\nend)","owner":{"_id":"699758acf0045c3983d2061a","username":"CryMeSomeWaves","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"699758acf0045c3983d2061a","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"